    "text": "By Editorial Board ,\n4 hours ago On Wednesday, Sept. 24, a DoorDash driver was involved in a fight with a Phi Delta Theta fraternity member at the University of Idaho. What began as a routine delivery turned into something far darker: an argument captured on video, a young man slammed into the ground, punched repeatedly and Life-Flighted to a hospital in Lewiston. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
